## Config
Same caches as E11 (DYN +A +blk128). Criteria rank non-window tokens per KV head; p, o, v are coarse estimates (exact for A).
expected-error: w_i = Σ_h p_hi² ( ||q_h||² g_ki² ||v_i − o_h||² / d² + g_vi² ), from the first-order error model.

